{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KLqNDqhDWgjAyEnDPb1Qem","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experimental data for each planned experiment in the experiment plan, under the \"median\" tier assumptions. I need to produce a single YAML block with all the predicted results, rationales, tables, figures, and analysis for each experiment.\n\nLet me carefully go through each planned experiment and generate realistic median-tier results.\n\nKey median tier parameters:\n- Qwen constrained PPL WikiText: 11.0-12.0\n- Qwen uniform 4-bit PPL WikiText: 15.0-15.5\n- Qwen PPL improvement: 22-27%\n\n\n- Llama PPL improvement: 10-20%\n- Mistral PPL improvement: 8-18%\n- Unconstrained MCKP PPL: 20-35\n- Compounding elbow k: 8-24\n- Hires nonzero head pct: 30-50%\n- C4 rank correlation with WikiText: 0.7-0.88\n- L0 auto discovery: partial (≥4-bit but not always 8-bit)\n\nNow I'm working through the first experiment plan where I'll remove the L0 exclusion and verify the solver can auto-discover L0 sensitivity.\n\nThe solver does identify L0 as important and assigns at least 4-bit precision, though it doesn't always reach full 8-bit, which means performance will be slightly worse than the fully constrained baseline since L0 heads aren't getting maximum protection.\n\nFor the Llama-3.1-8B replication, I'm expecting 10-20% improvement in median, but the 4:1 GQA ratio leaves less room for differentiation compared to other architectures, and L0 dominance shows up in two-thirds of the models. The Mistral-7B-v0.3 replication should see 8-18% improvement with its different architecture. I'm also planning a compounding effect sweep that varies the max 2-bit allocation from 0 to 112.\n\nLooking at the next set of experiments, the elbow in the compounding effect isn't sharp—it's somewhere between 8-24 bits with gradual PPL degradation rather than a clear step. I need to compare constrained MCKP against uniform allocation at different compression levels, and high-resolution profiling should improve mid-layer discrimination though the proportion of zero deltas stays above 65%. On C4 evaluation, improvements are smaller than WikiText-2 (15-20% versus 27%), with rank correlation between 0.7-0.88. I'm also checking RateQuant as a baseline—waterfilling on a discrete set should underperform—plus comparing against an oracle to see the MCKP gap, and testing cross-domain calibration robustness by measuring allocation agreement rates.\n\nNow I'm planning the final experiments: creating paper figures for visualization, evaluating on downstream tasks like MMLU and LongBench, and running profiling specifically on the 70B model.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10222,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10222},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0b60fef-0bc6-4a96-aa75-cf2876a49118","uuid":"c361a42b-58a5-4419-a535-49f5c6183d9b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KLqNDqhDWgjAyEnDPb1Qem","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1（heterogeneity）和 Claim 2（MCKP outperforms uniform）完整保留。\n  Claim 3（cardinality as regularization）从 \"principled regularization\" 降级为\n  \"effective heuristic with empirical motivation\"——compounding effect 真实存在，\n  但 elbow 不够 sharp，最优 k 需要 model-specific 调参而非 universal rule。\n  标题转向 \"discrete mixed-precision KV cache quantization via constrained MCKP\"，\n  弱化 regularization story，强化 practical system contribution。\n  补充 \"sensitivity to k\" analysis 表格，展示 k 在 ±50% 范围内 PPL 变化幅度，\n  论证方法对 k 选择 robust enough for practical use。\n  RateQuant 差异化需更 nuanced——承认 continuous waterfilling 在某些 regime 可能 competitive，\n  discrete MCKP 优势集中在 extreme compression ratios。\n  L0 auto-discovery story 弱化为 \"solver recognizes L0 criticality and assigns elevated bit-width\"\n  而非 \"solver independently rediscovers 8-bit for L0\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"L0 Auto-Discovery (Unconstrained L0)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      移除 L0 exclusion constraint，仅保留 max_2bit=8。验证 solver 是否从 profiling data\n      自动为 Layer 0 heads 分配高 bit-width。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_constrained_ppl_wikitext_no_l0_exclusion: 11.78\n      l0_head_avg_bitwidth: 5.3\n      l0_heads_at_8bit_fraction: 0.43\n      l0_heads_at_4bit_fraction: 0.57\n      l0_heads_at_2bit_fraction: 0.0\n      non_l0_allocation_agreement_with_baseline: 0.91\n      ppl_delta_vs_full_constrained: +0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 solver 能识别 L0 的异常高 profiling delta（100× 均值），\n      因此绝不会给 L0 分配 2-bit。但由于 profiling delta 的绝对值在 4-bit 和 8-bit\n      之间差异不够极端（约 3-5× 而非 10×），加之 MCKP 在预算紧张时倾向用 4-bit\n      覆盖更多 heads，solver 会将约 43% 的 L0 heads 提升到 8-bit，其余留在 4-bit。\n      这导致 PPL 比完全约束版本（11.23）高约 0.55，因为部分 L0 heads 的 4-bit 量化\n      引入了可测量但非灾难性的退化。故事从 \"solver 独立重新发现 8-bit 保护\"\n      变为 \"solver 识别 L0 关键性并分配高于均值的 bit-width\"——仍支持 heterogeneity claim\n      但 auto-discovery narrative 需要降调。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Layer 0 Head Allocation (No L0 Exclusion)\"\n        columns: [\"head_id\", \"profiling_delta\", \"assigned_bitwidth\", \"baseline_bitwidth\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 0.0847, 8, 8]\n          - [1, 0.0623, 8, 8]\n          - [2, 0.0412, 8, 8]\n          - [3, 0.0289, 4, 8]\n          - [4, 0.0201, 4, 8]\n          - [5, 0.0178, 4, 8]\n          - [6, 0.0134, 4, 8]\n      - name: \"PPL Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"ppl_wikitext2\", \"compression_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"constrained (with L0 exclusion)\", 11.23, \"4.0×\"]\n          - [\"no L0 exclusion (max_2bit=8 only)\", 11.78, \"4.0×\"]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 15.45, \"4.0×\"]\n          - [\"unconstrained\", 36.92, \"4.0×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: L0 head bit-width assignments comparing full-constrained vs no-L0-exclusion. Shows partial but not complete 8-bit recovery.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Solver 能自动将 L0 从 uniform 基线中区分出来（0/7 heads 被分配 2-bit，3/7 获得 8-bit），\n      但未完全复现手动 L0 exclusion 的效果。PPL 退化 0.55 说明 L0 heads 的 4-bit vs 8-bit\n      差异是真实的但非灾难性的。论文中应将此结果呈现为：solver 的 profiling-driven allocation\n      自然倾向于保护 L0，但若先验已知 L0 的特殊性，显式约束仍能提供额外收益。\n      这支持了 \"profiling captures heterogeneity\" 但弱化了 \"fully automatic discovery\" 的叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline Replication\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B（GQA ratio 4:1）上完整复现 profiling → MCKP → eval pipeline。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: 8.92\n      llama_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext: 7.58\n      llama_ppl_improvement_pct: 15.0\n      llama_unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 24.6\n      llama_l0_profiling_delta_ratio_vs_mean: 67.0\n      llama_l0_assigned_bitwidth: 8\n      llama_num_kv_heads: 8\n      llama_heads_at_2bit: 2\n      llama_heads_at_4bit: 4\n      llama_heads_at_8bit: 2\n      llama_compression_ratio: 4.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 使用 GQA ratio 4:1（8 KV heads per layer × 32 layers = 256 total KV heads），\n      远少于 Qwen 的 7:1 ratio。KV head 数量少意味着：（1）每个 head 的 profiling delta\n      信噪比更高（更少 heads 聚合），但（2）solver 的 allocation 灵活性受限——\n      离散 MCKP 在粗粒度下的优化空间更小。15% 的改进低于 Qwen 的 27%，\n      主要因为 Llama 的 KV heads 更少使得 uniform 4-bit 的 \"浪费\" 也更少。\n      L0 dominance 在 Llama 上复现（delta ratio ~67×，低于 Qwen 的 100× 但仍显著），\n      支持 heterogeneity 的跨模型泛化。Unconstrained PPL 24.6（vs Qwen 36.92）\n      因为更少的 heads 意味着 compounding 的绝对影响较小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Allocation Summary\"\n        columns: [\"layer_group\", \"num_heads\", \"dominant_bitwidth\", \"profiling_delta_mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Layer 0\", 8, \"8-bit\", 0.0523]\n          - [\"Layers 1-7\", 56, \"4-bit\", 0.00089]\n          - [\"Layers 8-23\", 128, \"4-bit (some 2-bit)\", 0.00042]\n          - [\"Layers 24-31\", 64, \"4-bit\", 0.00071]\n      - name: \"Llama PPL Results\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"ppl_wikitext2\", \"compression\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 baseline\", 6.24, \"1×\"]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 8.92, \"4×\"]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP\", 7.58, \"4×\"]\n          - [\"unconstrained MCKP\", 24.6, \"4×\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"model\", \"gqa_ratio\", \"total_kv_heads\", \"uniform_ppl\", \"constrained_ppl\", \"improvement_pct\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"7:1\", 896, 15.45, 11.23, 27]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"4:1\", 256, 8.92, 7.58, 15]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side per-head profiling heatmap for Qwen vs Llama, showing L0 dominance in both but different magnitude.\"\n      - \"Bar chart comparing improvement % across models, annotated with GQA ratio.\"\n    analysis: >\n      15% 改进证实方法跨 GQA ratio 泛化，但幅度折扣符合预期：fewer KV heads → less heterogeneity\n      to exploit → smaller gains from mixed-precision。L0 dominance 跨模型复现是重要的 positive signal。\n      论文需要讨论 GQA ratio 作为方法增益的预测因子——higher GQA ratio（more KV heads）\n      ≈ more opportunity for mixed-precision optimization。这将 Qwen 的高增益和 Llama 的低增益\n      统一在一个连贯的解释框架下。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline Replication\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上完整复现 pipeline，测试跨架构族的泛化性。\n    expected_results:\n      mistral_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: 9.34\n      mistral_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext: 8.21\n      mistral_ppl_improvement_pct: 12.1\n      mistral_unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 21.8\n      mistral_l0_profiling_delta_ratio_vs_mean: 42.0\n      mistral_l0_assigned_bitwidth: 8\n      mistral_num_kv_heads: 8\n      mistral_compression_ratio: 4.0\n      mistral_l0_dominance: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 使用 GQA ratio 4:1（与 Llama 相同），8 KV heads/layer × 32 layers = 256 heads。\n      但 Mistral 的 sliding window attention（window=4096）改变了 KV cache 的使用模式：\n      window 外的 tokens 被丢弃，使得量化对 window 内 tokens 的影响更集中。\n      这导致两个效应：（1）uniform baseline PPL 略差于 Llama（9.34 vs 8.92），\n      因为 sliding window 下每个 token 的 KV cache 利用率更高、量化噪声影响更集中；\n      （2）mixed-precision 的改进空间反而略小（12.1% vs 15%），因为 Mistral 的\n      head sensitivity 分布比 Llama 更均匀——L0 dominance 存在但弱化（42× vs 67×）。\n      这使得 Mistral 成为三模型中增益最小的，但方法仍然 positive。\n      L0 dominance 在 2/3 模型上强复现（Qwen 100×, Llama 67×），Mistral 42× 是弱复现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Mistral-7B PPL Results\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"ppl_wikitext2\", \"compression\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 baseline\", 6.89, \"1×\"]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 9.34, \"4×\"]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP\", 8.21, \"4×\"]\n          - [\"unconstrained MCKP\", 21.8, \"4×\"]\n      - name: \"Three-Model Summary\"\n        columns: [\"model\", \"gqa_ratio\", \"kv_heads\", \"improvement_pct\", \"l0_delta_ratio\", \"l0_8bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"7:1\", 896, 27, \"100×\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"4:1\", 256, 15, \"67×\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B-v0.3\", \"4:1\", 256, 12.1, \"42×\", \"yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-panel profiling heatmap (Qwen / Llama / Mistral) showing L0 dominance pattern with decreasing magnitude.\"\n    analysis: >\n      12.1% 改进是三模型中最低的，但方法在所有模型上都 positive，且 unconstrained 在所有模型上\n      都灾难性失败（21.8 vs 8.21），一致证明 cardinality constraint 的必要性。\n      GQA ratio 与 improvement % 的相关性（r=0.95 across 3 points）提供了一个简洁的预测框架，\n      但样本太小不宜做强 claim——论文中作为 observation 而非 conclusion 呈现。\n      Mistral 的 sliding window attention 是一个有趣的 confound，值得在 discussion 中提及。\n\n  - name: \"Compounding Effect Characterization Sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit 从 0 到 112，绘制 PPL vs max_2bit curve，\n      定位 compounding threshold。\n    expected_results:\n      sweep_results:\n        - {max_2bit: 0, ppl: 11.23, note: \"no 2-bit allowed\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 4, ppl: 11.31, note: \"minimal degradation\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 8, ppl: 11.52, note: \"current constraint setting\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 16, ppl: 12.34, note: \"noticeable but controlled\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 24, ppl: 13.89, note: \"degradation accelerating\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 48, ppl: 18.45, note: \"severe degradation\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 75, ppl: 27.31, note: \"approaching unconstrained\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 112, ppl: 36.92, note: \"unconstrained equivalent\"}\n      compounding_elbow_k: 16\n      elbow_sharpness: \"gradual — PPL increases ~1.0 per 8 heads for k<16, then ~3.0 per 8 heads for k>16\"\n      ppl_at_k_minus50pct: 11.31\n      ppl_at_k_plus50pct: 12.34\n      k_sensitivity_range_ppl: \"[11.31, 12.34] for k ∈ [8, 24]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 elbow 存在但不锐利。k=0→8 阶段，solver 选择的 2-bit heads 都是\n      profiling delta 极低的 mid-layer heads，compounding effect 微弱（PPL +0.29）。\n      k=8→16，开始触及一些 delta 不那么低的 heads，compounding 缓慢积累（PPL +0.82）。\n      k=16→24 是过渡区，PPL 增速明显加快（+1.55），因为 solver 被迫将一些有 non-trivial delta\n      的 heads 降到 2-bit。k=24→48 是 compounding 主导区（+4.56），多个 2-bit heads\n      的联合退化远超独立 profiling delta 之和。k>48 后 PPL 急剧恶化趋向 unconstrained。\n      关键问题是 elbow 在 k=16 附近而非一个 sharp step——从 k=8 到 k=24，PPL 从 11.52 到 13.89，\n      是一个 ~2.4 的渐变而非阶跃。这意味着 \"最优 k\" 的选择有一个宽松的 sweet spot（8-16）\n      而非一个精确的临界值，支持方法的 practical robustness 但弱化了 \"principled threshold\" 的叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Compounding Effect Sweep\"\n        columns: [\"max_2bit (k)\", \"ppl_wikitext2\", \"Δppl_vs_k0\", \"heads_at_2bit\", \"avg_2bit_head_delta\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 11.23, 0.0, 0, \"N/A\"]\n          - [4, 11.31, 0.08, 4, 0.00012]\n          - [8, 11.52, 0.29, 8, 0.00018]\n          - [16, 12.34, 1.11, 16, 0.00031]\n          - [24, 13.89, 2.66, 24, 0.00047]\n          - [48, 18.45, 7.22, 48, 0.00068]\n          - [75, 27.31, 16.08, 75, 0.00084]\n          - [112, 36.92, 25.69, 112, 0.00091]\n      - name: \"Sensitivity to k Analysis (±50% around k=16)\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"ppl\", \"Δppl_vs_k16\", \"pct_change_vs_k16\"]\n        rows:\n          - [8, 11.52, -0.82, \"-6.6%\"]\n          - [12, 11.89, -0.45, \"-3.6%\"]\n          - [16, 12.34, 0.0, \"0%\"]\n          - [20, 13.02, +0.68, \"+5.5%\"]\n          - [24, 13.89, +1.55, \"+12.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs max_2bit curve with shaded 'recommended zone' (k=4 to k=16). Log-scale y-axis to show gradual-then-steep transition.\"\n      - \"Derivative plot (ΔPPL / Δk) showing the rate of PPL change — confirms acceleration but no sharp discontinuity.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Compounding effect 是真实的且显著的（unconstrained PPL 36.92 vs k=8 PPL 11.52，3.2× 差距），\n      但 elbow 是 gradual 而非 sharp。论文策略：（1）展示 sensitivity-to-k table 证明在 k ∈ [8,16]\n      范围内 PPL 变化仅 6.6%，方法对 k 选择足够 robust；（2）将 \"compounding threshold\" 重新框架为\n      \"compounding zone\"（k=16 到 k=48），避免暗示存在 precise critical point；\n      （3）建议 k = 0.1 × total_kv_heads 作为 practical default（Qwen: 0.1×896≈90 太大，\n      实际 sweet spot 约 0.01×896≈9，需要用 non-L0 head fraction 做归一化）。\n      Claim 3 降级为 \"cardinality constraints provide effective regularization with a broad\n      operational sweet spot\" 而非 \"principled threshold with sharp transition\"。\n\n  - name: \"Budget Sweep (2×, 4×, 8× Compression)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在不同压缩比下的表现，\n      与同预算 uniform baseline 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      budget_2x:\n        uniform_ppl: 10.89\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 10.42\n        improvement_pct: 4.3\n        dominant_allocation: \"mostly 8-bit with some 4-bit\"\n      budget_4x:\n        uniform_ppl: 15.45\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.52\n        improvement_pct: 25.4\n        dominant_allocation: \"mixed 4-bit/8-bit with 8 heads at 2-bit\"\n      budget_8x:\n        uniform_ppl: 78.3\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 32.6\n        improvement_pct: 58.4\n        dominant_allocation: \"mostly 2-bit, L0 at 4-bit, critical heads at 8-bit\"\n      fp16_baseline_ppl: 9.87\n    result_rationale: >\n      2× compression：预算充裕，uniform 8-bit 已经很好（PPL 10.89 vs FP16 9.87），\n      mixed-precision 只能通过将少数 insensitive heads 降到 4-bit 并将节省的 budget\n      分配给已经是 8-bit 的 heads（无法超过 16-bit cap），改进空间极小（4.3%）。\n      这是 RateQuant continuous waterfilling 可能 competitive 的 regime。\n      4× compression：这是方法的 sweet spot，uniform 4-bit 在 sensitive heads 上浪费大量质量，\n      MCKP 通过将 insensitive heads 降到 2-bit 释放 budget 保护 L0 和其他关键 heads 在 8-bit，\n      改进显著（25.4%）。8× compression：极端压缩下 uniform 2-bit 灾难性（PPL 78.3），\n      MCKP 仍能通过保留少数关键 heads 在 4-8 bit 大幅改善（PPL 32.6），\n      但绝对 PPL 仍然很高，方法价值体现在 \"从不可用到勉强可用\" 而非 \"从好到更好\"。\n      improvement % 随压缩比单调递增（4.3% → 25.4% → 58.4%），因为更极端的 uniform baseline\n      在 sensitive heads 上的浪费更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Budget Sweep Results\"\n        columns: [\"compression\", \"budget\", \"uniform_ppl\", \"mckp_ppl\", \"improvement_%\", \"l0_bitwidth\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2×\", 0.50, 10.89, 10.42, 4.3, 16]\n          - [\"4×\", 0.25, 15.45, 11.52, 25.4, 8]\n          - [\"8×\", 0.125, 78.3, 32.6, 58.4, 4]\n      - name: \"Allocation Distribution by Budget\"\n        columns: [\"compression\", \"pct_2bit\", \"pct_4bit\", \"pct_8bit\", \"pct_16bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2×\", 0, 18, 82, 0]\n          - [\"4×\", 0.9, 71, 28, 0.1]\n          - [\"8×\", 68, 24, 8, 0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs compression ratio curves for uniform vs constrained MCKP, showing divergence increasing at higher compression.\"\n      - \"Stacked bar chart of bit-width allocation distribution across compression ratios.\"\n    analysis: >\n      结果清晰地展示了方法的 operating regime：在 mild compression（2×）下增益有限，\n      在 extreme compression（8×）下增益最大但绝对质量仍差，sweet spot 在 4×。\n      论文中应诚实展示 2× 的小增益——这也是 RateQuant waterfilling 可能 competitive 的区间，\n      需要在 differentiation 讨论中承认。8× 的结果提供了 extreme compression 的 data point，\n      展示方法在 uniform 完全失败的 regime 仍能提供有意义的改善。\n\n  - name: \"High-Resolution Profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      使用 64 seq × 2048 tokens（vs current 16×512）进行高分辨率 profiling，\n      重新运行 MCKP，测试是否能发现 mid-layer heterogeneity。\n    expected_results:\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: 38.4\n      lores_nonzero_head_pct: 16.2\n      hires_constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.34\n      lores_constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.52\n      ppl_improvement_from_hires: 1.6\n      hires_delta_zero_pct: 61.6\n      mid_layer_new_nonzero_heads: 198\n      mid_layer_total_heads: 640\n      mid_layer_new_nonzero_pct: 30.9\n      l0_delta_change_pct: 2.3\n      hires_profiling_time_hours: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 hires profiling 能将 nonzero-delta head 比例从 16.2% 提升到 38.4%\n      （约 2.4× improvement），但 delta=0 heads 仍占 61.6%（> 65% threshold 的 borderline）。\n      改善集中在 mid-layers（layers 8-23）：这些层的 heads 在 lores 下大量归零是因为\n      16 seq × 512 tokens 不足以在统计上区分微弱的量化退化。Hires 的更大样本量\n      降低了测量噪声 floor，使得一些真实但微弱的 delta 浮出水面。\n      但根本问题未解决：大多数 mid-layer heads 的真实 sensitivity 确实接近零\n      （uniform 4-bit 对它们几乎无影响），所以即使 profiling 分辨率无限高，\n      delta=0 比例也不会降到 50% 以下。PPL 改善仅 1.6%（11.34 vs 11.52）——\n      hires 发现的新 nonzero heads 的 delta 值本身很小，对 MCKP allocation 的影响有限。\n      结论：hires profiling 是有用的 refinement 但不是 game-changer。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Profiling Resolution Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"lores (16×512)\", \"hires (64×2048)\", \"change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"nonzero-delta heads\", \"145/896 (16.2%)\", \"344/896 (38.4%)\", \"+137%\"]\n          - [\"mid-layer nonzero heads\", \"42/640\", \"240/640\", \"+471%\"]\n          - [\"L0 mean delta\", 0.0831, 0.0850, \"+2.3%\"]\n          - [\"mean nonzero delta (non-L0)\", 0.00073, 0.00041, \"-44% (more low-delta heads now nonzero)\"]\n          - [\"profiling time\", \"0.4h\", \"2.8h\", \"7×\"]\n      - name: \"MCKP Results with Hires Profiling\"\n        columns: [\"profiling\", \"constrained_ppl\", \"allocation_changes\", \"improvement_vs_lores\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lores\", 11.52, \"baseline\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"hires\", 11.34, \"23 heads changed bitwidth\", \"1.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap comparison: lores vs hires profiling delta across all 896 heads, showing mid-layer resolution improvement.\"\n      - \"Histogram of newly-nonzero head deltas — concentrated near measurement floor, explaining limited PPL impact.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Hires profiling 显著改善了 mid-layer 的信号分辨率但 PPL 收益有限。\n      论文中应将此呈现为：（1）hires 确认了 sensitivity heterogeneity 是真实的而非\n      profiling artifact——低分辨率下看起来 \"同质\" 的 mid-layers 实际上有可测量的差异；\n      （2）但 MCKP allocation 的 PPL 增益主要来自 L0 和少数 extreme heads 的正确处理，\n      mid-layer 的精细区分是 diminishing returns；（3）建议 lores 作为 practical default\n      （7× 更快），hires 作为 optional refinement。delta=0 比例 61.6% 仍然高于理想值，\n      但论文中不需要将此作为 limitation 强调——重要的是方法在 lores 下已经足够好。\n\n  - name: \"C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上用 C4 替代 WikiText-2 进行评估，测试跨数据集泛化性。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_uniform4bit_ppl_c4: 18.23\n      qwen_constrained_mckp_ppl_c4: 15.12\n      qwen_ppl_improvement_pct_c4: 17.1\n      qwen_unconstrained_mckp_ppl_c4: 42.8\n      c4_wikitext_rank_correlation: 0.82\n      c4_wikitext_allocation_agreement: 0.87\n      c4_l0_dominance: true\n      c4_l0_delta_ratio: 85.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      C4 的 PPL 绝对值高于 WikiText-2（C4 文本更多样、分布更宽），但改进趋势一致。\n      17.1% 的改进低于 WikiText-2 的 27%，原因是：（1）C4 的更大文本多样性使得\n      per-head sensitivity 的 variance 更高，profiling 基于 WikiText-2 calibration\n      在 C4 上的迁移存在 domain gap；（2）C4 中短文本比例更高，KV cache 利用率不同，\n      某些 heads 的 sensitivity ranking 发生微小偏移。rank correlation 0.82 表明\n      大部分 sensitivity structure 跨数据集保持——L0 仍然是最 sensitive 的——\n      但 mid-layer 的 ranking 有约 18% 的 disagreement。allocation agreement 87%\n      意味着 MCKP 在 C4 上会做出 87% 相同的 bit-width 决定，差异集中在 mid-layer\n      的边际 heads（profiling delta 接近 decision boundary 的 heads）。\n      unconstrained PPL 42.8（比 WikiText-2 的 36.92 更差）进一步确认 compounding effect\n      在 C4 上同样存在。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"C4 vs WikiText-2 Results (Qwen2.5-7B, 4× compression)\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"WikiText-2\", \"C4\", \"ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 baseline PPL\", 9.87, 12.34, 1.25]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit PPL\", 15.45, 18.23, 1.18]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP PPL\", 11.23, 15.12, 1.35]\n          - [\"unconstrained MCKP PPL\", 36.92, 42.8, 1.16]\n          - [\"improvement %\", 27, 17.1, 0.63]\n          - [\"L0 delta ratio\", \"100×\", \"85×\", 0.85]\n      - name: \"Head Allocation Agreement\"\n        columns: [\"layer_group\", \"agreement_%\", \"typical_disagreement\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Layer 0\", 100, \"none\"]\n          - [\"Layers 1-7\", 94, \"8→4 bit on 2 heads\"]\n          - [\"Layers 8-23\", 82, \"4→2 bit or 2→4 bit on marginal heads\"]\n          - [\"Layers 24-31\", 89, \"minor reranking near decision boundary\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: per-head profiling delta (WikiText-2 calibration) vs (C4 calibration) with rank correlation annotated.\"\n      - \"PPL improvement bar chart: WikiText-2 vs C4, showing consistent positive but reduced magnitude on C4.\"\n    analysis: >\n      C4 结果确认方法跨数据集有效但增益折扣约 37%（17.1% vs 27%）。\n      论文中需要两个讨论点：（1）rank correlation 0.82 说明 profiling 在 same-distribution\n      calibration 下最优，cross-distribution 有折扣但不失效——建议 calibration data\n      与 deployment data 同分布时效果最佳；（2）即使在 cross-distribution 设定下，\n      constrained MCKP 仍显著优于 uniform（17.1% improvement），且远优于 unconstrained\n      （PPL 15.12 vs 42.8），核心 claims 在 C4 上完整成立。\n\n  - name: \"RateQuant Waterfilling Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      实现 reverse waterfilling baseline 在离散 action set {2,4,8,16}-bit 上的投影，\n      与 constrained MCKP 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      waterfilling_continuous_ppl: 12.45\n      waterfilling_discretized_ppl: 14.23\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.52\n      mckp_advantage_over_waterfilling_pct: 19.1\n      waterfilling_l0_bitwidth: 6.8\n      waterfilling_discretized_l0_bitwidth: 8\n      waterfilling_num_2bit_heads: 34\n      waterfilling_discretized_num_2bit_heads: 34\n      discretization_loss_ppl: 1.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 在 continuous bit-width 空间下是 R-D optimal，\n      但投影到离散 action set 时产生两个问题：（1）discretization loss——continuous 解中\n      L0 heads 获得 ~6.8 bit 被四舍五入到 8-bit，mid-layer heads 获得 ~2.3 bit\n      被截断到 2-bit，累积 rounding error 导致 PPL 从 12.45 上升到 14.23；\n      （2）waterfilling 不考虑 compounding——它的 additive D(b)=α·β^{-b} 模型\n      在 34 个 heads 同时分配 2-bit 时低估了联合退化，导致 2-bit heads 过多。\n      constrained MCKP 的 19.1% 优势来自两个源头：native discrete optimization（避免 rounding）\n      和 cardinality constraint（限制 2-bit heads 数量）。\n      在 2× compression regime 下差距会缩小（waterfilling 的 continuous 解\n      几乎全在 4-8 bit range，discretization loss 小），这需要在论文中诚实讨论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RateQuant vs Constrained MCKP\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"ppl\", \"num_2bit\", \"num_4bit\", \"num_8bit\", \"num_16bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"waterfilling (continuous, projected)\", 12.45, \"N/A\", \"N/A\", \"N/A\", \"N/A\"]\n          - [\"waterfilling (discretized)\", 14.23, 34, 588, 274, 0]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP (k=8)\", 11.52, 8, 637, 251, 0]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 15.45, 0, 896, 0, 0]\n      - name: \"Advantage Decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"source_of_advantage\", \"estimated_ppl_contribution\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"native discrete optimization (vs rounding)\", \"~1.0\"]\n          - [\"cardinality constraint (vs unconstrained 2-bit)\", \"~1.7\"]\n          - [\"total advantage\", \"~2.7 (14.23 → 11.52)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head bit-width scatter: waterfilling discretized vs MCKP constrained. Highlight divergence in 2-bit assignment count.\"\n      - \"PPL comparison bar chart with decomposed advantage sources annotated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      MCKP 对 waterfilling 的优势在 4× compression 下显著（19.1%），但需要 nuanced 讨论：\n      （1）在 2× compression 下 waterfilling 可能 competitive（discretization loss 小，\n      compounding 不严重），论文中应展示完整 compression sweep 的对比；\n      （2）advantage decomposition 显示约 37% 来自 native discrete optimization，\n      63% 来自 cardinality constraint——后者是我们的核心 novelty。\n      这支持了论文的 differentiation story 但需要承认 waterfilling 不是 uniformly inferior。\n\n  - name: \"Oracle Comparison (Subset Brute-Force)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 的 3-4 layer groups 上暴力搜索最优 allocation，\n      量化 MCKP 与 oracle 的 gap。\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_subset_ppl: 11.12\n      mckp_subset_ppl: 11.34\n      mckp_oracle_gap_pct: 2.0\n      oracle_search_space_size: 262144\n      oracle_compute_hours: 5.2\n      oracle_allocation_differs_from_mckp: 3\n      oracle_differs_on_which_heads: \"mid-layer marginal heads near delta decision boundary\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Brute-force oracle 在 3-4 layer groups（~16-32 heads per group, 4 bit-width options）\n      的搜索空间为 4^{16} 到 4^{32}——对 3 groups × 16 heads 使用剪枝可搜索。\n      Oracle 能发现 MCKP 因 additive distortion 假设而遗漏的少数联合最优分配，\n      但由于 cardinality constraint 已经 regularize 了最大的 non-additivity source\n      （2-bit compounding），剩余 gap 很小。2.0% 的 gap（11.12 vs 11.34）说明\n      constrained MCKP 是 near-optimal 的——差异仅来自 mid-layer 几个边际 heads\n      的 4-bit vs 8-bit 选择，这些 heads 的独立 profiling delta 接近 decision boundary，\n      联合效应使 oracle 倾向于为它们多分配 0.2 个 \"等效 bit\"。\n      这个 gap 小到可以 argue MCKP 的 polynomial-time 复杂度（vs oracle 的 exponential）\n      使其在实践中远优于 oracle search。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Oracle vs MCKP (Subset Evaluation)\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subset_ppl\", \"full_model_ppl_estimate\", \"compute_time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"brute-force oracle\", 11.12, \"~11.05 (extrapolated)\", \"5.2h\"]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP\", 11.34, 11.52, \"0.03h\"]\n          - [\"gap\", \"+0.22\", \"+0.47\", \"173×\"]\n      - name: \"Allocation Differences\"\n        columns: [\"head_id\", \"oracle_bitwidth\", \"mckp_bitwidth\", \"delta_independent\", \"delta_joint\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L14_H3\", 8, 4, 0.00048, 0.00089]\n          - [\"L17_H1\", 8, 4, 0.00041, 0.00076]\n          - [\"L22_H5\", 4, 8, 0.00052, 0.00033]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: MCKP allocation vs oracle allocation for subset heads, with disagreements highlighted.\"\n    analysis: >\n      2.0% optimality gap 是一个强结果——证明 MCKP 在 polynomial time 内达到 near-optimal，\n      且 cardinality constraint 有效 regularize 了 profiling error 的主要来源。\n      论文中可以 claim \"constrained MCKP achieves within 2% of brute-force oracle\n      at 173× less compute\"，这是一个有力的 practical contribution statement。\n      Oracle 发现的 3 个 allocation 差异都在 mid-layer 的边际 heads 上——\n      独立 delta 和联合 delta 的比值约 0.5-0.7，说明即使在约束下\n      仍存在残余 non-additivity，但影响已被控制到 negligible 水平。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      交叉校准：在 C4 上 calibrate，WikiText-2 上 evaluate（反之亦然），\n      报告 per-head allocation agreement rate。\n    expected_results:\n      calib_wiki_eval_c4_ppl: 15.67\n      calib_c4_eval_wiki_ppl: 11.89\n      calib_wiki_eval_wiki_ppl: 11.52\n      calib_c4_eval_c4_ppl: 15.12\n      cross_calib_ppl_penalty_wiki: 3.2\n      cross_calib_ppl_penalty_c4: 3.6\n      allocation_agreement_wiki_vs_c4: 0.87\n      l0_agreement: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-calibration penalty 存在但可控：C4-calibrated profile 在 WikiText-2 上的 PPL\n      是 11.89（vs same-domain 11.52），penalty 3.2%。反向（Wiki→C4）penalty 3.6%。\n      Penalty 来自 mid-layer heads 的 sensitivity ranking 在不同数据分布下的微小偏移——\n      C4 的短文本更多使得某些处理长距离依赖的 heads 在 C4 calibration 中被低估。\n      但 L0 agreement 是 100%——L0 的 extreme sensitivity 在任何合理的 calibration set\n      上都会被正确识别。allocation agreement 87% 意味着 113/896 heads 的 bitwidth 不同，\n      但这些 heads 都在 4→2 bit 或 2→4 bit 的边界上，individual impact 很小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Calibration Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"calibration\", \"eval_dataset\", \"ppl\", \"vs_same_domain\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"WikiText-2\", \"WikiText-2\", 11.52, \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"C4\", \"WikiText-2\", 11.89, \"+3.2%\"]\n          - [\"C4\", \"C4\", 15.12, \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"WikiText-2\", \"C4\", 15.67, \"+3.6%\"]\n      - name: \"Allocation Agreement by Layer Group\"\n        columns: [\"layer_group\", \"agreement_%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Layer 0\", 100]\n          - [\"Layers 1-7\", 94]\n          - [\"Layers 8-23\", 82]\n          - [\"Layers 24-31\", 88]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 heatmap of cross-calibration PPL matrix.\"\n      - \"Allocation agreement histogram by layer position.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-calibration penalty 3-4% 对于 practical deployment 是可接受的——\n      用户不需要 deployment-specific calibration data，任何合理的通用文本（C4-like）即可。\n      论文中应呈现为 practical robustness evidence：方法不 brittle 于 calibration choice。\n      同时诚实承认 same-domain calibration 仍然更好，建议有条件时使用 domain-matched data。\n\n  - name: \"Head Sensitivity Visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      生成论文质量的可视化图：per-head profiling delta heatmap、compounding curve、\n      budget allocation comparison。\n    expected_results:\n      figures_generated: 4\n      figure_list:\n        - \"fig1_profiling_heatmap.pdf: 896-head heatmap (28 layers × 32 heads for Qwen), log-scale color, L0 dominant\"\n        - \"fig2_compounding_curve.pdf: PPL vs max_2bit with shaded zones and elbow annotation\"\n        - \"fig3_allocation_comparison.pdf: side-by-side uniform vs MCKP allocation bar chart\"\n        - \"fig4_cross_model_summary.pdf: three-model improvement comparison with GQA ratio annotation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 visualization 实验，不产生新数据——依赖 plan_004 和 plan_006 的结果。\n      Median 档下关键 visualization 挑战：（1）compounding curve 没有 sharp elbow，\n      需要用 shaded \"recommended zone\" 而非 point annotation 来标记 sweet spot；\n      （2）profiling heatmap 中 61.6% 的 heads 仍是 delta=0（即使 hires），\n      需要选择合适的 color scale 避免大面积单色——建议 log scale + 将 0 标为浅灰而非白色；\n      （3）cross-model 图中 Mistral 的 12.1% improvement 视觉上可能显得 \"不够好\"——\n      需要配合 annotation 解释 GQA ratio 的影响。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"fig1: Per-head profiling delta heatmap (Qwen2.5-7B, hires). Log-scale colormap, L0 row in bright red, mid-layers in blue-to-white gradient. 61.6% delta=0 heads shown as light gray. Includes colorbar with delta values.\"\n      - \"fig2: Compounding effect curve. X-axis: max_2bit (k), Y-axis: PPL. Blue line with confidence interval shading. Shaded green zone for k∈[4,16] labeled 'recommended range'. No sharp elbow marked — instead, gradual transition zone annotated.\"\n      - \"fig3: Allocation comparison at 4× compression. Three stacked bars (uniform / unconstrained MCKP / constrained MCKP) showing bit-width distribution. PPL annotated above each bar.\"\n      - \"fig4: Three-model improvement bar chart. X-axis: model, Y-axis: PPL improvement %. Bars annotated with GQA ratio. Dashed line at 0% for reference.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Visualization 设计需要反映 median 档的 honest story：compounding 是 gradual zone\n      而非 sharp cliff，cross-model improvement 有显著差异但方向一致，profiling resolution\n      有改善空间。避免 cherry-picking visual angles——如果 elbow 不 sharp，不要用 zoomed axes\n      制造 sharpness 的错觉。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Evaluation (MMLU / LongBench)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B（4× compression）上评估 MMLU 和 LongBench，\n      测试 PPL 改进是否迁移到 downstream tasks。\n    expected_results:\n      fp16_mmlu: 68.2\n      uniform4bit_mmlu: 64.8\n      constrained_mckp_mmlu: 66.9\n      mmlu_recovery_pct: 61.8\n      fp16_longbench_avg: 42.1\n      uniform4bit_longbench_avg: 35.7\n      constrained_mckp_longbench_avg: 39.4\n      longbench_recovery_pct: 57.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改进到 downstream task 的迁移通常有折扣：PPL 衡量 next-token prediction 质量的\n      全局统计量，而 MMLU 测试特定知识和推理能力，LongBench 测试长上下文理解。\n      MMLU：uniform 4-bit 导致 3.4 point 退化（68.2→64.8），constrained MCKP 恢复其中约\n      62%（64.8→66.9），剩余 1.3 point gap 来自 L0 以外的 knowledge-encoding heads\n      的量化损失（MCKP 优先保护 sensitivity 最高的 heads，但 MMLU 关心的 \"知识\" 可能\n      分布在 sensitivity 中等的 heads 上）。LongBench：长上下文任务对 KV cache 质量更敏感\n      因为累积了更多 quantized tokens，uniform 4-bit 退化更大（42.1→35.7，-15.2%），\n      constrained MCKP 恢复约 58%（35.7→39.4）。恢复率低于 PPL improvement（62%/58% vs 27%\n      的 PPL improvement）因为 downstream metrics 有更高的 variance 和更复杂的 quality→score mapping。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Downstream Task Results (Qwen2.5-7B, 4× compression)\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"MMLU\", \"LongBench_avg\", \"PPL_WikiText2\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16\", 68.2, 42.1, 9.87]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 64.8, 35.7, 15.45]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP\", 66.9, 39.4, 11.52]\n      - name: \"Recovery Rate\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"fp16_score\", \"uniform_loss\", \"mckp_recovery\", \"recovery_pct\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 68.2, -3.4, +2.1, \"61.8%\"]\n          - [\"LongBench\", 42.1, -6.4, +3.7, \"57.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: FP16 / uniform / MCKP scores for MMLU and LongBench side by side.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream task 结果是 positive 但不 spectacular——MCKP 恢复了 ~60% 的 uniform 退化。\n      论文中应将此定位为 \"PPL gains translate to meaningful downstream improvements\"\n      而非 \"PPL fully predicts downstream quality\"。P2 priority 意味着如果时间紧张\n      可以将此降为 appendix，但 at least MMLU 结果应出现在 main paper 中。\n\n  - name: \"70B Profiling-Only\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-72B 上仅运行 distortion profiling（不做 full eval），\n      分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size 缩放。\n    expected_results:\n      l0_profiling_delta_ratio_vs_mean_72b: 78.0\n      l0_profiling_delta_ratio_vs_mean_7b: 100.0\n      delta_zero_pct_72b: 72.3\n      delta_zero_pct_7b: 83.8\n      sensitivity_gini_72b: 0.89\n      sensitivity_gini_7b: 0.94\n      profiling_time_hours: 3.8\n      total_kv_heads_72b: 640\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B 模型有 80 layers × 8 KV heads/layer = 640 total heads（GQA ratio 10:1）。\n      L0 dominance 预期存在但可能略弱化（delta ratio 78× vs 7B 的 100×），\n      因为更深的网络使得 L0 的 \"信息瓶颈\" 效应被更多中间层分摊。\n      Sensitivity 分布仍高度非均匀（Gini 0.89）但略低于 7B（0.94），\n      因为 72B 的更多 layers 提供了更多 heads 分担 sensitivity，使分布略微均匀化。\n      delta=0 比例 72.3%——低于 7B 的 83.8%，因为 72B 每层只有 8 个 KV heads（vs 7B 的 32），\n      每个 head 承载更多信息，量化对每个 head 的影响更容易被检测到。\n      这个结果支持 \"sensitivity heterogeneity scales with model size\" 的一般性 claim，\n      同时暗示 larger models 可能从 mixed-precision 中获益更大（更多 total heads + 每 head 更 sensitive）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Scale Comparison: 7B vs 72B Profiling\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"Qwen2.5-72B\", \"trend\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"total KV heads\", 896, 640, \"72B fewer due to higher GQA ratio\"]\n          - [\"L0 delta ratio\", \"100×\", \"78×\", \"↓ slight\"]\n          - [\"delta=0 %\", \"83.8%\", \"72.3%\", \"↓ better resolution\"]\n          - [\"sensitivity Gini\", 0.94, 0.89, \"↓ slightly more uniform\"]\n          - [\"top-3.6% heads' contribution to total delta\", \"70%+\", \"~62%\", \"↓ less concentrated\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side profiling heatmaps: 7B (28×32) vs 72B (80×8), showing structural similarity in L0 dominance pattern.\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B profiling 结果支持 sensitivity heterogeneity 是跨 scale 的一般现象，\n      但 concentration 程度随模型增大略有下降。论文中作为 scaling evidence 呈现——\n      不做 full eval 意味着不能 claim PPL improvement 数字，但 profiling pattern 的一致性\n      增强了方法在 larger models 上适用的 plausibility。P2 priority，建议作为 appendix figure。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10222,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10222},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0b60fef-0bc6-4a96-aa75-cf2876a49118","uuid":"16f5b6ea-287a-4c0e-a0a5-77f405d7f1de"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":298229,"duration_api_ms":299479,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1（heterogeneity）和 Claim 2（MCKP outperforms uniform）完整保留。\n  Claim 3（cardinality as regularization）从 \"principled regularization\" 降级为\n  \"effective heuristic with empirical motivation\"——compounding effect 真实存在，\n  但 elbow 不够 sharp，最优 k 需要 model-specific 调参而非 universal rule。\n  标题转向 \"discrete mixed-precision KV cache quantization via constrained MCKP\"，\n  弱化 regularization story，强化 practical system contribution。\n  补充 \"sensitivity to k\" analysis 表格，展示 k 在 ±50% 范围内 PPL 变化幅度，\n  论证方法对 k 选择 robust enough for practical use。\n  RateQuant 差异化需更 nuanced——承认 continuous waterfilling 在某些 regime 可能 competitive，\n  discrete MCKP 优势集中在 extreme compression ratios。\n  L0 auto-discovery story 弱化为 \"solver recognizes L0 criticality and assigns elevated bit-width\"\n  而非 \"solver independently rediscovers 8-bit for L0\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"L0 Auto-Discovery (Unconstrained L0)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      移除 L0 exclusion constraint，仅保留 max_2bit=8。验证 solver 是否从 profiling data\n      自动为 Layer 0 heads 分配高 bit-width。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_constrained_ppl_wikitext_no_l0_exclusion: 11.78\n      l0_head_avg_bitwidth: 5.3\n      l0_heads_at_8bit_fraction: 0.43\n      l0_heads_at_4bit_fraction: 0.57\n      l0_heads_at_2bit_fraction: 0.0\n      non_l0_allocation_agreement_with_baseline: 0.91\n      ppl_delta_vs_full_constrained: +0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 solver 能识别 L0 的异常高 profiling delta（100× 均值），\n      因此绝不会给 L0 分配 2-bit。但由于 profiling delta 的绝对值在 4-bit 和 8-bit\n      之间差异不够极端（约 3-5× 而非 10×），加之 MCKP 在预算紧张时倾向用 4-bit\n      覆盖更多 heads，solver 会将约 43% 的 L0 heads 提升到 8-bit，其余留在 4-bit。\n      这导致 PPL 比完全约束版本（11.23）高约 0.55，因为部分 L0 heads 的 4-bit 量化\n      引入了可测量但非灾难性的退化。故事从 \"solver 独立重新发现 8-bit 保护\"\n      变为 \"solver 识别 L0 关键性并分配高于均值的 bit-width\"——仍支持 heterogeneity claim\n      但 auto-discovery narrative 需要降调。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Layer 0 Head Allocation (No L0 Exclusion)\"\n        columns: [\"head_id\", \"profiling_delta\", \"assigned_bitwidth\", \"baseline_bitwidth\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 0.0847, 8, 8]\n          - [1, 0.0623, 8, 8]\n          - [2, 0.0412, 8, 8]\n          - [3, 0.0289, 4, 8]\n          - [4, 0.0201, 4, 8]\n          - [5, 0.0178, 4, 8]\n          - [6, 0.0134, 4, 8]\n      - name: \"PPL Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"ppl_wikitext2\", \"compression_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"constrained (with L0 exclusion)\", 11.23, \"4.0×\"]\n          - [\"no L0 exclusion (max_2bit=8 only)\", 11.78, \"4.0×\"]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 15.45, \"4.0×\"]\n          - [\"unconstrained\", 36.92, \"4.0×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: L0 head bit-width assignments comparing full-constrained vs no-L0-exclusion. Shows partial but not complete 8-bit recovery.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Solver 能自动将 L0 从 uniform 基线中区分出来（0/7 heads 被分配 2-bit，3/7 获得 8-bit），\n      但未完全复现手动 L0 exclusion 的效果。PPL 退化 0.55 说明 L0 heads 的 4-bit vs 8-bit\n      差异是真实的但非灾难性的。论文中应将此结果呈现为：solver 的 profiling-driven allocation\n      自然倾向于保护 L0，但若先验已知 L0 的特殊性，显式约束仍能提供额外收益。\n      这支持了 \"profiling captures heterogeneity\" 但弱化了 \"fully automatic discovery\" 的叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline Replication\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B（GQA ratio 4:1）上完整复现 profiling → MCKP → eval pipeline。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: 8.92\n      llama_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext: 7.58\n      llama_ppl_improvement_pct: 15.0\n      llama_unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 24.6\n      llama_l0_profiling_delta_ratio_vs_mean: 67.0\n      llama_l0_assigned_bitwidth: 8\n      llama_num_kv_heads: 8\n      llama_heads_at_2bit: 2\n      llama_heads_at_4bit: 4\n      llama_heads_at_8bit: 2\n      llama_compression_ratio: 4.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 使用 GQA ratio 4:1（8 KV heads per layer × 32 layers = 256 total KV heads），\n      远少于 Qwen 的 7:1 ratio。KV head 数量少意味着：（1）每个 head 的 profiling delta\n      信噪比更高（更少 heads 聚合），但（2）solver 的 allocation 灵活性受限——\n      离散 MCKP 在粗粒度下的优化空间更小。15% 的改进低于 Qwen 的 27%，\n      主要因为 Llama 的 KV heads 更少使得 uniform 4-bit 的 \"浪费\" 也更少。\n      L0 dominance 在 Llama 上复现（delta ratio ~67×，低于 Qwen 的 100× 但仍显著），\n      支持 heterogeneity 的跨模型泛化。Unconstrained PPL 24.6（vs Qwen 36.92）\n      因为更少的 heads 意味着 compounding 的绝对影响较小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Allocation Summary\"\n        columns: [\"layer_group\", \"num_heads\", \"dominant_bitwidth\", \"profiling_delta_mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Layer 0\", 8, \"8-bit\", 0.0523]\n          - [\"Layers 1-7\", 56, \"4-bit\", 0.00089]\n          - [\"Layers 8-23\", 128, \"4-bit (some 2-bit)\", 0.00042]\n          - [\"Layers 24-31\", 64, \"4-bit\", 0.00071]\n      - name: \"Llama PPL Results\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"ppl_wikitext2\", \"compression\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 baseline\", 6.24, \"1×\"]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 8.92, \"4×\"]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP\", 7.58, \"4×\"]\n          - [\"unconstrained MCKP\", 24.6, \"4×\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"model\", \"gqa_ratio\", \"total_kv_heads\", \"uniform_ppl\", \"constrained_ppl\", \"improvement_pct\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"7:1\", 896, 15.45, 11.23, 27]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"4:1\", 256, 8.92, 7.58, 15]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side per-head profiling heatmap for Qwen vs Llama, showing L0 dominance in both but different magnitude.\"\n      - \"Bar chart comparing improvement % across models, annotated with GQA ratio.\"\n    analysis: >\n      15% 改进证实方法跨 GQA ratio 泛化，但幅度折扣符合预期：fewer KV heads → less heterogeneity\n      to exploit → smaller gains from mixed-precision。L0 dominance 跨模型复现是重要的 positive signal。\n      论文需要讨论 GQA ratio 作为方法增益的预测因子——higher GQA ratio（more KV heads）\n      ≈ more opportunity for mixed-precision optimization。这将 Qwen 的高增益和 Llama 的低增益\n      统一在一个连贯的解释框架下。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline Replication\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上完整复现 pipeline，测试跨架构族的泛化性。\n    expected_results:\n      mistral_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: 9.34\n      mistral_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext: 8.21\n      mistral_ppl_improvement_pct: 12.1\n      mistral_unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 21.8\n      mistral_l0_profiling_delta_ratio_vs_mean: 42.0\n      mistral_l0_assigned_bitwidth: 8\n      mistral_num_kv_heads: 8\n      mistral_compression_ratio: 4.0\n      mistral_l0_dominance: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 使用 GQA ratio 4:1（与 Llama 相同），8 KV heads/layer × 32 layers = 256 heads。\n      但 Mistral 的 sliding window attention（window=4096）改变了 KV cache 的使用模式：\n      window 外的 tokens 被丢弃，使得量化对 window 内 tokens 的影响更集中。\n      这导致两个效应：（1）uniform baseline PPL 略差于 Llama（9.34 vs 8.92），\n      因为 sliding window 下每个 token 的 KV cache 利用率更高、量化噪声影响更集中；\n      （2）mixed-precision 的改进空间反而略小（12.1% vs 15%），因为 Mistral 的\n      head sensitivity 分布比 Llama 更均匀——L0 dominance 存在但弱化（42× vs 67×）。\n      这使得 Mistral 成为三模型中增益最小的，但方法仍然 positive。\n      L0 dominance 在 2/3 模型上强复现（Qwen 100×, Llama 67×），Mistral 42× 是弱复现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Mistral-7B PPL Results\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"ppl_wikitext2\", \"compression\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 baseline\", 6.89, \"1×\"]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 9.34, \"4×\"]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP\", 8.21, \"4×\"]\n          - [\"unconstrained MCKP\", 21.8, \"4×\"]\n      - name: \"Three-Model Summary\"\n        columns: [\"model\", \"gqa_ratio\", \"kv_heads\", \"improvement_pct\", \"l0_delta_ratio\", \"l0_8bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"7:1\", 896, 27, \"100×\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"4:1\", 256, 15, \"67×\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B-v0.3\", \"4:1\", 256, 12.1, \"42×\", \"yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-panel profiling heatmap (Qwen / Llama / Mistral) showing L0 dominance pattern with decreasing magnitude.\"\n    analysis: >\n      12.1% 改进是三模型中最低的，但方法在所有模型上都 positive，且 unconstrained 在所有模型上\n      都灾难性失败（21.8 vs 8.21），一致证明 cardinality constraint 的必要性。\n      GQA ratio 与 improvement % 的相关性（r=0.95 across 3 points）提供了一个简洁的预测框架，\n      但样本太小不宜做强 claim——论文中作为 observation 而非 conclusion 呈现。\n      Mistral 的 sliding window attention 是一个有趣的 confound，值得在 discussion 中提及。\n\n  - name: \"Compounding Effect Characterization Sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit 从 0 到 112，绘制 PPL vs max_2bit curve，\n      定位 compounding threshold。\n    expected_results:\n      sweep_results:\n        - {max_2bit: 0, ppl: 11.23, note: \"no 2-bit allowed\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 4, ppl: 11.31, note: \"minimal degradation\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 8, ppl: 11.52, note: \"current constraint setting\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 16, ppl: 12.34, note: \"noticeable but controlled\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 24, ppl: 13.89, note: \"degradation accelerating\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 48, ppl: 18.45, note: \"severe degradation\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 75, ppl: 27.31, note: \"approaching unconstrained\"}\n        - {max_2bit: 112, ppl: 36.92, note: \"unconstrained equivalent\"}\n      compounding_elbow_k: 16\n      elbow_sharpness: \"gradual — PPL increases ~1.0 per 8 heads for k<16, then ~3.0 per 8 heads for k>16\"\n      ppl_at_k_minus50pct: 11.31\n      ppl_at_k_plus50pct: 12.34\n      k_sensitivity_range_ppl: \"[11.31, 12.34] for k ∈ [8, 24]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 elbow 存在但不锐利。k=0→8 阶段，solver 选择的 2-bit heads 都是\n      profiling delta 极低的 mid-layer heads，compounding effect 微弱（PPL +0.29）。\n      k=8→16，开始触及一些 delta 不那么低的 heads，compounding 缓慢积累（PPL +0.82）。\n      k=16→24 是过渡区，PPL 增速明显加快（+1.55），因为 solver 被迫将一些有 non-trivial delta\n      的 heads 降到 2-bit。k=24→48 是 compounding 主导区（+4.56），多个 2-bit heads\n      的联合退化远超独立 profiling delta 之和。k>48 后 PPL 急剧恶化趋向 unconstrained。\n      关键问题是 elbow 在 k=16 附近而非一个 sharp step——从 k=8 到 k=24，PPL 从 11.52 到 13.89，\n      是一个 ~2.4 的渐变而非阶跃。这意味着 \"最优 k\" 的选择有一个宽松的 sweet spot（8-16）\n      而非一个精确的临界值，支持方法的 practical robustness 但弱化了 \"principled threshold\" 的叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Compounding Effect Sweep\"\n        columns: [\"max_2bit (k)\", \"ppl_wikitext2\", \"Δppl_vs_k0\", \"heads_at_2bit\", \"avg_2bit_head_delta\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 11.23, 0.0, 0, \"N/A\"]\n          - [4, 11.31, 0.08, 4, 0.00012]\n          - [8, 11.52, 0.29, 8, 0.00018]\n          - [16, 12.34, 1.11, 16, 0.00031]\n          - [24, 13.89, 2.66, 24, 0.00047]\n          - [48, 18.45, 7.22, 48, 0.00068]\n          - [75, 27.31, 16.08, 75, 0.00084]\n          - [112, 36.92, 25.69, 112, 0.00091]\n      - name: \"Sensitivity to k Analysis (±50% around k=16)\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"ppl\", \"Δppl_vs_k16\", \"pct_change_vs_k16\"]\n        rows:\n          - [8, 11.52, -0.82, \"-6.6%\"]\n          - [12, 11.89, -0.45, \"-3.6%\"]\n          - [16, 12.34, 0.0, \"0%\"]\n          - [20, 13.02, +0.68, \"+5.5%\"]\n          - [24, 13.89, +1.55, \"+12.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs max_2bit curve with shaded 'recommended zone' (k=4 to k=16). Log-scale y-axis to show gradual-then-steep transition.\"\n      - \"Derivative plot (ΔPPL / Δk) showing the rate of PPL change — confirms acceleration but no sharp discontinuity.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Compounding effect 是真实的且显著的（unconstrained PPL 36.92 vs k=8 PPL 11.52，3.2× 差距），\n      但 elbow 是 gradual 而非 sharp。论文策略：（1）展示 sensitivity-to-k table 证明在 k ∈ [8,16]\n      范围内 PPL 变化仅 6.6%，方法对 k 选择足够 robust；（2）将 \"compounding threshold\" 重新框架为\n      \"compounding zone\"（k=16 到 k=48），避免暗示存在 precise critical point；\n      （3）建议 k = 0.1 × total_kv_heads 作为 practical default（Qwen: 0.1×896≈90 太大，\n      实际 sweet spot 约 0.01×896≈9，需要用 non-L0 head fraction 做归一化）。\n      Claim 3 降级为 \"cardinality constraints provide effective regularization with a broad\n      operational sweet spot\" 而非 \"principled threshold with sharp transition\"。\n\n  - name: \"Budget Sweep (2×, 4×, 8× Compression)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在不同压缩比下的表现，\n      与同预算 uniform baseline 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      budget_2x:\n        uniform_ppl: 10.89\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 10.42\n        improvement_pct: 4.3\n        dominant_allocation: \"mostly 8-bit with some 4-bit\"\n      budget_4x:\n        uniform_ppl: 15.45\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.52\n        improvement_pct: 25.4\n        dominant_allocation: \"mixed 4-bit/8-bit with 8 heads at 2-bit\"\n      budget_8x:\n        uniform_ppl: 78.3\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 32.6\n        improvement_pct: 58.4\n        dominant_allocation: \"mostly 2-bit, L0 at 4-bit, critical heads at 8-bit\"\n      fp16_baseline_ppl: 9.87\n    result_rationale: >\n      2× compression：预算充裕，uniform 8-bit 已经很好（PPL 10.89 vs FP16 9.87），\n      mixed-precision 只能通过将少数 insensitive heads 降到 4-bit 并将节省的 budget\n      分配给已经是 8-bit 的 heads（无法超过 16-bit cap），改进空间极小（4.3%）。\n      这是 RateQuant continuous waterfilling 可能 competitive 的 regime。\n      4× compression：这是方法的 sweet spot，uniform 4-bit 在 sensitive heads 上浪费大量质量，\n      MCKP 通过将 insensitive heads 降到 2-bit 释放 budget 保护 L0 和其他关键 heads 在 8-bit，\n      改进显著（25.4%）。8× compression：极端压缩下 uniform 2-bit 灾难性（PPL 78.3），\n      MCKP 仍能通过保留少数关键 heads 在 4-8 bit 大幅改善（PPL 32.6），\n      但绝对 PPL 仍然很高，方法价值体现在 \"从不可用到勉强可用\" 而非 \"从好到更好\"。\n      improvement % 随压缩比单调递增（4.3% → 25.4% → 58.4%），因为更极端的 uniform baseline\n      在 sensitive heads 上的浪费更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Budget Sweep Results\"\n        columns: [\"compression\", \"budget\", \"uniform_ppl\", \"mckp_ppl\", \"improvement_%\", \"l0_bitwidth\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2×\", 0.50, 10.89, 10.42, 4.3, 16]\n          - [\"4×\", 0.25, 15.45, 11.52, 25.4, 8]\n          - [\"8×\", 0.125, 78.3, 32.6, 58.4, 4]\n      - name: \"Allocation Distribution by Budget\"\n        columns: [\"compression\", \"pct_2bit\", \"pct_4bit\", \"pct_8bit\", \"pct_16bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2×\", 0, 18, 82, 0]\n          - [\"4×\", 0.9, 71, 28, 0.1]\n          - [\"8×\", 68, 24, 8, 0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs compression ratio curves for uniform vs constrained MCKP, showing divergence increasing at higher compression.\"\n      - \"Stacked bar chart of bit-width allocation distribution across compression ratios.\"\n    analysis: >\n      结果清晰地展示了方法的 operating regime：在 mild compression（2×）下增益有限，\n      在 extreme compression（8×）下增益最大但绝对质量仍差，sweet spot 在 4×。\n      论文中应诚实展示 2× 的小增益——这也是 RateQuant waterfilling 可能 competitive 的区间，\n      需要在 differentiation 讨论中承认。8× 的结果提供了 extreme compression 的 data point，\n      展示方法在 uniform 完全失败的 regime 仍能提供有意义的改善。\n\n  - name: \"High-Resolution Profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      使用 64 seq × 2048 tokens（vs current 16×512）进行高分辨率 profiling，\n      重新运行 MCKP，测试是否能发现 mid-layer heterogeneity。\n    expected_results:\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: 38.4\n      lores_nonzero_head_pct: 16.2\n      hires_constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.34\n      lores_constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.52\n      ppl_improvement_from_hires: 1.6\n      hires_delta_zero_pct: 61.6\n      mid_layer_new_nonzero_heads: 198\n      mid_layer_total_heads: 640\n      mid_layer_new_nonzero_pct: 30.9\n      l0_delta_change_pct: 2.3\n      hires_profiling_time_hours: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 hires profiling 能将 nonzero-delta head 比例从 16.2% 提升到 38.4%\n      （约 2.4× improvement），但 delta=0 heads 仍占 61.6%（> 65% threshold 的 borderline）。\n      改善集中在 mid-layers（layers 8-23）：这些层的 heads 在 lores 下大量归零是因为\n      16 seq × 512 tokens 不足以在统计上区分微弱的量化退化。Hires 的更大样本量\n      降低了测量噪声 floor，使得一些真实但微弱的 delta 浮出水面。\n      但根本问题未解决：大多数 mid-layer heads 的真实 sensitivity 确实接近零\n      （uniform 4-bit 对它们几乎无影响），所以即使 profiling 分辨率无限高，\n      delta=0 比例也不会降到 50% 以下。PPL 改善仅 1.6%（11.34 vs 11.52）——\n      hires 发现的新 nonzero heads 的 delta 值本身很小，对 MCKP allocation 的影响有限。\n      结论：hires profiling 是有用的 refinement 但不是 game-changer。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Profiling Resolution Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"lores (16×512)\", \"hires (64×2048)\", \"change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"nonzero-delta heads\", \"145/896 (16.2%)\", \"344/896 (38.4%)\", \"+137%\"]\n          - [\"mid-layer nonzero heads\", \"42/640\", \"240/640\", \"+471%\"]\n          - [\"L0 mean delta\", 0.0831, 0.0850, \"+2.3%\"]\n          - [\"mean nonzero delta (non-L0)\", 0.00073, 0.00041, \"-44% (more low-delta heads now nonzero)\"]\n          - [\"profiling time\", \"0.4h\", \"2.8h\", \"7×\"]\n      - name: \"MCKP Results with Hires Profiling\"\n        columns: [\"profiling\", \"constrained_ppl\", \"allocation_changes\", \"improvement_vs_lores\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lores\", 11.52, \"baseline\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"hires\", 11.34, \"23 heads changed bitwidth\", \"1.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap comparison: lores vs hires profiling delta across all 896 heads, showing mid-layer resolution improvement.\"\n      - \"Histogram of newly-nonzero head deltas — concentrated near measurement floor, explaining limited PPL impact.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Hires profiling 显著改善了 mid-layer 的信号分辨率但 PPL 收益有限。\n      论文中应将此呈现为：（1）hires 确认了 sensitivity heterogeneity 是真实的而非\n      profiling artifact——低分辨率下看起来 \"同质\" 的 mid-layers 实际上有可测量的差异；\n      （2）但 MCKP allocation 的 PPL 增益主要来自 L0 和少数 extreme heads 的正确处理，\n      mid-layer 的精细区分是 diminishing returns；（3）建议 lores 作为 practical default\n      （7× 更快），hires 作为 optional refinement。delta=0 比例 61.6% 仍然高于理想值，\n      但论文中不需要将此作为 limitation 强调——重要的是方法在 lores 下已经足够好。\n\n  - name: \"C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上用 C4 替代 WikiText-2 进行评估，测试跨数据集泛化性。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_uniform4bit_ppl_c4: 18.23\n      qwen_constrained_mckp_ppl_c4: 15.12\n      qwen_ppl_improvement_pct_c4: 17.1\n      qwen_unconstrained_mckp_ppl_c4: 42.8\n      c4_wikitext_rank_correlation: 0.82\n      c4_wikitext_allocation_agreement: 0.87\n      c4_l0_dominance: true\n      c4_l0_delta_ratio: 85.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      C4 的 PPL 绝对值高于 WikiText-2（C4 文本更多样、分布更宽），但改进趋势一致。\n      17.1% 的改进低于 WikiText-2 的 27%，原因是：（1）C4 的更大文本多样性使得\n      per-head sensitivity 的 variance 更高，profiling 基于 WikiText-2 calibration\n      在 C4 上的迁移存在 domain gap；（2）C4 中短文本比例更高，KV cache 利用率不同，\n      某些 heads 的 sensitivity ranking 发生微小偏移。rank correlation 0.82 表明\n      大部分 sensitivity structure 跨数据集保持——L0 仍然是最 sensitive 的——\n      但 mid-layer 的 ranking 有约 18% 的 disagreement。allocation agreement 87%\n      意味着 MCKP 在 C4 上会做出 87% 相同的 bit-width 决定，差异集中在 mid-layer\n      的边际 heads（profiling delta 接近 decision boundary 的 heads）。\n      unconstrained PPL 42.8（比 WikiText-2 的 36.92 更差）进一步确认 compounding effect\n      在 C4 上同样存在。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"C4 vs WikiText-2 Results (Qwen2.5-7B, 4× compression)\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"WikiText-2\", \"C4\", \"ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 baseline PPL\", 9.87, 12.34, 1.25]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit PPL\", 15.45, 18.23, 1.18]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP PPL\", 11.23, 15.12, 1.35]\n          - [\"unconstrained MCKP PPL\", 36.92, 42.8, 1.16]\n          - [\"improvement %\", 27, 17.1, 0.63]\n          - [\"L0 delta ratio\", \"100×\", \"85×\", 0.85]\n      - name: \"Head Allocation Agreement\"\n        columns: [\"layer_group\", \"agreement_%\", \"typical_disagreement\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Layer 0\", 100, \"none\"]\n          - [\"Layers 1-7\", 94, \"8→4 bit on 2 heads\"]\n          - [\"Layers 8-23\", 82, \"4→2 bit or 2→4 bit on marginal heads\"]\n          - [\"Layers 24-31\", 89, \"minor reranking near decision boundary\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: per-head profiling delta (WikiText-2 calibration) vs (C4 calibration) with rank correlation annotated.\"\n      - \"PPL improvement bar chart: WikiText-2 vs C4, showing consistent positive but reduced magnitude on C4.\"\n    analysis: >\n      C4 结果确认方法跨数据集有效但增益折扣约 37%（17.1% vs 27%）。\n      论文中需要两个讨论点：（1）rank correlation 0.82 说明 profiling 在 same-distribution\n      calibration 下最优，cross-distribution 有折扣但不失效——建议 calibration data\n      与 deployment data 同分布时效果最佳；（2）即使在 cross-distribution 设定下，\n      constrained MCKP 仍显著优于 uniform（17.1% improvement），且远优于 unconstrained\n      （PPL 15.12 vs 42.8），核心 claims 在 C4 上完整成立。\n\n  - name: \"RateQuant Waterfilling Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      实现 reverse waterfilling baseline 在离散 action set {2,4,8,16}-bit 上的投影，\n      与 constrained MCKP 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      waterfilling_continuous_ppl: 12.45\n      waterfilling_discretized_ppl: 14.23\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.52\n      mckp_advantage_over_waterfilling_pct: 19.1\n      waterfilling_l0_bitwidth: 6.8\n      waterfilling_discretized_l0_bitwidth: 8\n      waterfilling_num_2bit_heads: 34\n      waterfilling_discretized_num_2bit_heads: 34\n      discretization_loss_ppl: 1.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 在 continuous bit-width 空间下是 R-D optimal，\n      但投影到离散 action set 时产生两个问题：（1）discretization loss——continuous 解中\n      L0 heads 获得 ~6.8 bit 被四舍五入到 8-bit，mid-layer heads 获得 ~2.3 bit\n      被截断到 2-bit，累积 rounding error 导致 PPL 从 12.45 上升到 14.23；\n      （2）waterfilling 不考虑 compounding——它的 additive D(b)=α·β^{-b} 模型\n      在 34 个 heads 同时分配 2-bit 时低估了联合退化，导致 2-bit heads 过多。\n      constrained MCKP 的 19.1% 优势来自两个源头：native discrete optimization（避免 rounding）\n      和 cardinality constraint（限制 2-bit heads 数量）。\n      在 2× compression regime 下差距会缩小（waterfilling 的 continuous 解\n      几乎全在 4-8 bit range，discretization loss 小），这需要在论文中诚实讨论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RateQuant vs Constrained MCKP\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"ppl\", \"num_2bit\", \"num_4bit\", \"num_8bit\", \"num_16bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"waterfilling (continuous, projected)\", 12.45, \"N/A\", \"N/A\", \"N/A\", \"N/A\"]\n          - [\"waterfilling (discretized)\", 14.23, 34, 588, 274, 0]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP (k=8)\", 11.52, 8, 637, 251, 0]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 15.45, 0, 896, 0, 0]\n      - name: \"Advantage Decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"source_of_advantage\", \"estimated_ppl_contribution\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"native discrete optimization (vs rounding)\", \"~1.0\"]\n          - [\"cardinality constraint (vs unconstrained 2-bit)\", \"~1.7\"]\n          - [\"total advantage\", \"~2.7 (14.23 → 11.52)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head bit-width scatter: waterfilling discretized vs MCKP constrained. Highlight divergence in 2-bit assignment count.\"\n      - \"PPL comparison bar chart with decomposed advantage sources annotated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      MCKP 对 waterfilling 的优势在 4× compression 下显著（19.1%），但需要 nuanced 讨论：\n      （1）在 2× compression 下 waterfilling 可能 competitive（discretization loss 小，\n      compounding 不严重），论文中应展示完整 compression sweep 的对比；\n      （2）advantage decomposition 显示约 37% 来自 native discrete optimization，\n      63% 来自 cardinality constraint——后者是我们的核心 novelty。\n      这支持了论文的 differentiation story 但需要承认 waterfilling 不是 uniformly inferior。\n\n  - name: \"Oracle Comparison (Subset Brute-Force)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 的 3-4 layer groups 上暴力搜索最优 allocation，\n      量化 MCKP 与 oracle 的 gap。\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_subset_ppl: 11.12\n      mckp_subset_ppl: 11.34\n      mckp_oracle_gap_pct: 2.0\n      oracle_search_space_size: 262144\n      oracle_compute_hours: 5.2\n      oracle_allocation_differs_from_mckp: 3\n      oracle_differs_on_which_heads: \"mid-layer marginal heads near delta decision boundary\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Brute-force oracle 在 3-4 layer groups（~16-32 heads per group, 4 bit-width options）\n      的搜索空间为 4^{16} 到 4^{32}——对 3 groups × 16 heads 使用剪枝可搜索。\n      Oracle 能发现 MCKP 因 additive distortion 假设而遗漏的少数联合最优分配，\n      但由于 cardinality constraint 已经 regularize 了最大的 non-additivity source\n      （2-bit compounding），剩余 gap 很小。2.0% 的 gap（11.12 vs 11.34）说明\n      constrained MCKP 是 near-optimal 的——差异仅来自 mid-layer 几个边际 heads\n      的 4-bit vs 8-bit 选择，这些 heads 的独立 profiling delta 接近 decision boundary，\n      联合效应使 oracle 倾向于为它们多分配 0.2 个 \"等效 bit\"。\n      这个 gap 小到可以 argue MCKP 的 polynomial-time 复杂度（vs oracle 的 exponential）\n      使其在实践中远优于 oracle search。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Oracle vs MCKP (Subset Evaluation)\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subset_ppl\", \"full_model_ppl_estimate\", \"compute_time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"brute-force oracle\", 11.12, \"~11.05 (extrapolated)\", \"5.2h\"]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP\", 11.34, 11.52, \"0.03h\"]\n          - [\"gap\", \"+0.22\", \"+0.47\", \"173×\"]\n      - name: \"Allocation Differences\"\n        columns: [\"head_id\", \"oracle_bitwidth\", \"mckp_bitwidth\", \"delta_independent\", \"delta_joint\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L14_H3\", 8, 4, 0.00048, 0.00089]\n          - [\"L17_H1\", 8, 4, 0.00041, 0.00076]\n          - [\"L22_H5\", 4, 8, 0.00052, 0.00033]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: MCKP allocation vs oracle allocation for subset heads, with disagreements highlighted.\"\n    analysis: >\n      2.0% optimality gap 是一个强结果——证明 MCKP 在 polynomial time 内达到 near-optimal，\n      且 cardinality constraint 有效 regularize 了 profiling error 的主要来源。\n      论文中可以 claim \"constrained MCKP achieves within 2% of brute-force oracle\n      at 173× less compute\"，这是一个有力的 practical contribution statement。\n      Oracle 发现的 3 个 allocation 差异都在 mid-layer 的边际 heads 上——\n      独立 delta 和联合 delta 的比值约 0.5-0.7，说明即使在约束下\n      仍存在残余 non-additivity，但影响已被控制到 negligible 水平。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      交叉校准：在 C4 上 calibrate，WikiText-2 上 evaluate（反之亦然），\n      报告 per-head allocation agreement rate。\n    expected_results:\n      calib_wiki_eval_c4_ppl: 15.67\n      calib_c4_eval_wiki_ppl: 11.89\n      calib_wiki_eval_wiki_ppl: 11.52\n      calib_c4_eval_c4_ppl: 15.12\n      cross_calib_ppl_penalty_wiki: 3.2\n      cross_calib_ppl_penalty_c4: 3.6\n      allocation_agreement_wiki_vs_c4: 0.87\n      l0_agreement: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-calibration penalty 存在但可控：C4-calibrated profile 在 WikiText-2 上的 PPL\n      是 11.89（vs same-domain 11.52），penalty 3.2%。反向（Wiki→C4）penalty 3.6%。\n      Penalty 来自 mid-layer heads 的 sensitivity ranking 在不同数据分布下的微小偏移——\n      C4 的短文本更多使得某些处理长距离依赖的 heads 在 C4 calibration 中被低估。\n      但 L0 agreement 是 100%——L0 的 extreme sensitivity 在任何合理的 calibration set\n      上都会被正确识别。allocation agreement 87% 意味着 113/896 heads 的 bitwidth 不同，\n      但这些 heads 都在 4→2 bit 或 2→4 bit 的边界上，individual impact 很小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Calibration Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"calibration\", \"eval_dataset\", \"ppl\", \"vs_same_domain\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"WikiText-2\", \"WikiText-2\", 11.52, \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"C4\", \"WikiText-2\", 11.89, \"+3.2%\"]\n          - [\"C4\", \"C4\", 15.12, \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"WikiText-2\", \"C4\", 15.67, \"+3.6%\"]\n      - name: \"Allocation Agreement by Layer Group\"\n        columns: [\"layer_group\", \"agreement_%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Layer 0\", 100]\n          - [\"Layers 1-7\", 94]\n          - [\"Layers 8-23\", 82]\n          - [\"Layers 24-31\", 88]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 heatmap of cross-calibration PPL matrix.\"\n      - \"Allocation agreement histogram by layer position.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-calibration penalty 3-4% 对于 practical deployment 是可接受的——\n      用户不需要 deployment-specific calibration data，任何合理的通用文本（C4-like）即可。\n      论文中应呈现为 practical robustness evidence：方法不 brittle 于 calibration choice。\n      同时诚实承认 same-domain calibration 仍然更好，建议有条件时使用 domain-matched data。\n\n  - name: \"Head Sensitivity Visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      生成论文质量的可视化图：per-head profiling delta heatmap、compounding curve、\n      budget allocation comparison。\n    expected_results:\n      figures_generated: 4\n      figure_list:\n        - \"fig1_profiling_heatmap.pdf: 896-head heatmap (28 layers × 32 heads for Qwen), log-scale color, L0 dominant\"\n        - \"fig2_compounding_curve.pdf: PPL vs max_2bit with shaded zones and elbow annotation\"\n        - \"fig3_allocation_comparison.pdf: side-by-side uniform vs MCKP allocation bar chart\"\n        - \"fig4_cross_model_summary.pdf: three-model improvement comparison with GQA ratio annotation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 visualization 实验，不产生新数据——依赖 plan_004 和 plan_006 的结果。\n      Median 档下关键 visualization 挑战：（1）compounding curve 没有 sharp elbow，\n      需要用 shaded \"recommended zone\" 而非 point annotation 来标记 sweet spot；\n      （2）profiling heatmap 中 61.6% 的 heads 仍是 delta=0（即使 hires），\n      需要选择合适的 color scale 避免大面积单色——建议 log scale + 将 0 标为浅灰而非白色；\n      （3）cross-model 图中 Mistral 的 12.1% improvement 视觉上可能显得 \"不够好\"——\n      需要配合 annotation 解释 GQA ratio 的影响。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"fig1: Per-head profiling delta heatmap (Qwen2.5-7B, hires). Log-scale colormap, L0 row in bright red, mid-layers in blue-to-white gradient. 61.6% delta=0 heads shown as light gray. Includes colorbar with delta values.\"\n      - \"fig2: Compounding effect curve. X-axis: max_2bit (k), Y-axis: PPL. Blue line with confidence interval shading. Shaded green zone for k∈[4,16] labeled 'recommended range'. No sharp elbow marked — instead, gradual transition zone annotated.\"\n      - \"fig3: Allocation comparison at 4× compression. Three stacked bars (uniform / unconstrained MCKP / constrained MCKP) showing bit-width distribution. PPL annotated above each bar.\"\n      - \"fig4: Three-model improvement bar chart. X-axis: model, Y-axis: PPL improvement %. Bars annotated with GQA ratio. Dashed line at 0% for reference.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Visualization 设计需要反映 median 档的 honest story：compounding 是 gradual zone\n      而非 sharp cliff，cross-model improvement 有显著差异但方向一致，profiling resolution\n      有改善空间。避免 cherry-picking visual angles——如果 elbow 不 sharp，不要用 zoomed axes\n      制造 sharpness 的错觉。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Evaluation (MMLU / LongBench)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B（4× compression）上评估 MMLU 和 LongBench，\n      测试 PPL 改进是否迁移到 downstream tasks。\n    expected_results:\n      fp16_mmlu: 68.2\n      uniform4bit_mmlu: 64.8\n      constrained_mckp_mmlu: 66.9\n      mmlu_recovery_pct: 61.8\n      fp16_longbench_avg: 42.1\n      uniform4bit_longbench_avg: 35.7\n      constrained_mckp_longbench_avg: 39.4\n      longbench_recovery_pct: 57.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改进到 downstream task 的迁移通常有折扣：PPL 衡量 next-token prediction 质量的\n      全局统计量，而 MMLU 测试特定知识和推理能力，LongBench 测试长上下文理解。\n      MMLU：uniform 4-bit 导致 3.4 point 退化（68.2→64.8），constrained MCKP 恢复其中约\n      62%（64.8→66.9），剩余 1.3 point gap 来自 L0 以外的 knowledge-encoding heads\n      的量化损失（MCKP 优先保护 sensitivity 最高的 heads，但 MMLU 关心的 \"知识\" 可能\n      分布在 sensitivity 中等的 heads 上）。LongBench：长上下文任务对 KV cache 质量更敏感\n      因为累积了更多 quantized tokens，uniform 4-bit 退化更大（42.1→35.7，-15.2%），\n      constrained MCKP 恢复约 58%（35.7→39.4）。恢复率低于 PPL improvement（62%/58% vs 27%\n      的 PPL improvement）因为 downstream metrics 有更高的 variance 和更复杂的 quality→score mapping。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Downstream Task Results (Qwen2.5-7B, 4× compression)\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"MMLU\", \"LongBench_avg\", \"PPL_WikiText2\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16\", 68.2, 42.1, 9.87]\n          - [\"uniform 4-bit\", 64.8, 35.7, 15.45]\n          - [\"constrained MCKP\", 66.9, 39.4, 11.52]\n      - name: \"Recovery Rate\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"fp16_score\", \"uniform_loss\", \"mckp_recovery\", \"recovery_pct\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 68.2, -3.4, +2.1, \"61.8%\"]\n          - [\"LongBench\", 42.1, -6.4, +3.7, \"57.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: FP16 / uniform / MCKP scores for MMLU and LongBench side by side.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream task 结果是 positive 但不 spectacular——MCKP 恢复了 ~60% 的 uniform 退化。\n      论文中应将此定位为 \"PPL gains translate to meaningful downstream improvements\"\n      而非 \"PPL fully predicts downstream quality\"。P2 priority 意味着如果时间紧张\n      可以将此降为 appendix，但 at least MMLU 结果应出现在 main paper 中。\n\n  - name: \"70B Profiling-Only\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-72B 上仅运行 distortion profiling（不做 full eval），\n      分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size 缩放。\n    expected_results:\n      l0_profiling_delta_ratio_vs_mean_72b: 78.0\n      l0_profiling_delta_ratio_vs_mean_7b: 100.0\n      delta_zero_pct_72b: 72.3\n      delta_zero_pct_7b: 83.8\n      sensitivity_gini_72b: 0.89\n      sensitivity_gini_7b: 0.94\n      profiling_time_hours: 3.8\n      total_kv_heads_72b: 640\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B 模型有 80 layers × 8 KV heads/layer = 640 total heads（GQA ratio 10:1）。\n      L0 dominance 预期存在但可能略弱化（delta ratio 78× vs 7B 的 100×），\n      因为更深的网络使得 L0 的 \"信息瓶颈\" 效应被更多中间层分摊。\n      Sensitivity 分布仍高度非均匀（Gini 0.89）但略低于 7B（0.94），\n      因为 72B 的更多 layers 提供了更多 heads 分担 sensitivity，使分布略微均匀化。\n      delta=0 比例 72.3%——低于 7B 的 83.8%，因为 72B 每层只有 8 个 KV heads（vs 7B 的 32），\n      每个 head 承载更多信息，量化对每个 head 的影响更容易被检测到。\n      这个结果支持 \"sensitivity heterogeneity scales with model size\" 的一般性 claim，\n      同时暗示 larger models 可能从 mixed-precision 中获益更大（更多 total heads + 每 head 更 sensitive）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Scale Comparison: 7B vs 72B Profiling\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"Qwen2.5-72B\", \"trend\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"total KV heads\", 896, 640, \"72B fewer due to higher GQA ratio\"]\n          - [\"L0 delta ratio\", \"100×\", \"78×\", \"↓ slight\"]\n          - [\"delta=0 %\", \"83.8%\", \"72.3%\", \"↓ better resolution\"]\n          - [\"sensitivity Gini\", 0.94, 0.89, \"↓ slightly more uniform\"]\n          - [\"top-3.6% heads' contribution to total delta\", \"70%+\", \"~62%\", \"↓ less concentrated\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side profiling heatmaps: 7B (28×32) vs 72B (80×8), showing structural similarity in L0 dominance pattern.\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B profiling 结果支持 sensitivity heterogeneity 是跨 scale 的一般现象，\n      但 concentration 程度随模型增大略有下降。论文中作为 scaling evidence 呈现——\n      不做 full eval 意味着不能 claim PPL improvement 数字，但 profiling pattern 的一致性\n      增强了方法在 larger models 上适用的 plausibility。P2 priority，建议作为 appendix figure。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c0b60fef-0bc6-4a96-aa75-cf2876a49118","total_cost_usd":0.47009399999999996,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10222,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":15798,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10222,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":15798,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10222,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10222},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5181,"outputTokens":29,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005326,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":15798,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10222,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.46476799999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"complete